## 7. Concurrency works

Two IE520s on tb470 have run full suites start-to-finish simultaneously (2002 on u4 alongside
2003 on u5), sharing the testbox's tftpd and eth1, with no interference observed. Addresses derive
from the tty number (`ipOffset = ttyNumber + 2`), so they cannot collide. Halves wall-clock for a
two-DUT campaign — prefer it.

